# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.killtest).
# Whether a relaunch after a termination, without any language change or install, is black the
# way Sileo's respring leaves it: Sileo opened and left to draw, killed with SIGKILL, and opened
# again by URL. The runner is devices/thyme/launchtest.sh
# (SCENE=out/thyme-boot/root-killtest.apfs), a screenshot every two seconds; the window server's
# audit says in the log whether the display was opaque black.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 6
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen sileo://package/tree
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 25 tap 0.32 0.601 wait 4 tap 0.32 0.601 wait 4 tap 0.9 0.14 wait 6
/usr/bin/killall -9 Sileo
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 8
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen sileo://package/tree
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30
